    <DataNode elementId="AT4G36810-MONOMER" textLabel="Heterodimeric geranylgeranyl pyrophosphate synthase large subunit 1, chloroplastic" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="P34802" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="600" centerY="455" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; gene &lt;i&gt;GGPS1&lt;/i&gt; when expressed in recombinant &lt;i&gt;E.coli&lt;/i&gt; was shown to encode for a protein catalyzing the condensation of farnesyl pyrophosphate (FPP) and isopentenyl pyrophosphate (IPP) to produce geranylgeranyl diphosphate (GGPP) |CITS:[10759500]|. &lt;i&gt;In planta&lt;/i&gt;, the protein was shown to be localized in the chloroplasts of epidermal cells and leaf guard cells, and in the etioplasts of roots |CITS:[10759500]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT4G36810-MONOMER" />
